{
  "name": "Shopify AI Support Agent",
  "nodes": [
    {
      "parameters": {
        "content": "## 🛒 SHOPIFY AI SUPPORT AGENT\n**What it does:** Every new support email is triaged by AI → order number extracted → Shopify order looked up → routine questions answered instantly, refund/order-change requests saved as human drafts, everything else escalated to Slack → a Telegram digest summarizes the run.\n\n**You'll need:**\n- Gmail OAuth2 credential (the support inbox)\n- Shopify Admin API access token with `read_orders` scope (custom app in your store admin)\n- OpenAI API key (platform.openai.com)\n- Google Sheets OAuth2 credential + a tab named `Support Inbox`\n- Slack bot token + channel, Telegram bot token + chat ID\n\n**Status flow in Sheets:** `RECEIVED` → `TRIAGED` → `AUTO_RESOLVED` / `DRAFT_CREATED` / `ESCALATED`",
        "height": 220,
        "width": 5320,
        "color": 5
      },
      "id": "58485513-ee6a-4a49-83b8-258896395901",
      "name": "STICKY — Title",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        -240,
        -160
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "content": "## STEP 1 — New email → extract order number\nGmail trigger fires every minute → order number is pulled from the subject/body with a regex (`#1234` or `order 1234`). Emails without one still continue — the order lookup just comes back empty.",
        "height": 420,
        "width": 1000,
        "color": 4
      },
      "id": "a4db0be8-aa98-46b3-8990-84a814ec5611",
      "name": "STICKY — STEP 1",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        -240,
        180
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "content": "## STEP 2 — Log to Sheets + Shopify lookup\nEvery email is appended to the `Support Inbox` tab with status `RECEIVED` → the order number is looked up in Shopify (lookup errors are swallowed so triage never blocks).",
        "height": 420,
        "width": 720,
        "color": 4
      },
      "id": "8c3d3a6a-23fe-4278-9470-e17197458a07",
      "name": "STICKY — STEP 2",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        700,
        180
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "content": "## STEP 3 — AI triage with structured output\nAI Agent reads the email + order JSON and returns intent (`order_status` / `policy_question` / `refund_request` / `order_change` / `other`), confidence 0–100, a ready-to-send draft reply, and `needs_human` → sheet flips to `TRIAGED`.",
        "height": 560,
        "width": 940,
        "color": 4
      },
      "id": "c33689de-3d7d-4e0b-9ab0-5e4c73da01d2",
      "name": "STICKY — STEP 3",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        1440,
        180
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "content": "## STEP 4 — Route: auto-reply / human draft / Slack\n`auto_resolvable` = routine intent AND confidence ≥ threshold AND no human flag → Gmail sends the reply → `AUTO_RESOLVED`. Money/order-change or flagged emails → a Gmail draft for a human → `DRAFT_CREATED`. Everything else → Slack alert → `ESCALATED`.",
        "height": 880,
        "width": 1720,
        "color": 4
      },
      "id": "45626a87-123b-4f6e-8361-d2f1f8079f6d",
      "name": "STICKY — STEP 4",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        2400,
        20
      ]
    },
    {
