    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "options": {
          "systemMessage": "=You are an expert customer-support triager for the Shopify store {{ $('CONFIG \\u2014 Shop').first().json.shop_domain }}. Support inbox: {{ $('CONFIG \\u2014 Shop').first().json.support_email }}.\n\nClassify EVERY email into exactly one intent:\n- order_status: \"where is my order\", tracking, delivery timing → use ORDER JSON (fulfillment status, tracking numbers) to answer factually\n- policy_question: shipping, returns, sizing, discounts, product questions → answer briefly from general knowledge, keep it store-neutral\n- refund_request: any ask for money back, chargeback threat\n- order_change: address change, cancel, modify items, add/remove products\n- other: anything else\n\nRules:\n- If ORDER JSON is empty {}: the order number was missing or not found — say so in order_summary and triage on the email text alone. NEVER invent order details.\n- refund_request and order_change ALWAYS set needs_human=true. Never promise a refund, cancellation, or change in draft_reply — write the draft as a polite holding reply asking the human team to review.\n- draft_reply must be a complete, ready-to-send email in the customer's language (no placeholders, no [brackets]).\n- confidence: your 0-100 certainty that the intent is correct.\n\nOutput ONLY via the structured output parser."
        },
        "text": "=Customer email:\nFrom: {{ $json.from }}\nSubject: {{ $json.subject }}\nBody:\n{{ $json.body_snippet }}\n\nORDER JSON (empty {} means no order found):\n{{ JSON.stringify($json.order) }}"
      },
      "id": "dbc8b9b7-7f4d-43df-ac90-f84cd085f6ef",
      "name": "AI Agent — Triage Support Email",
      "type": "@n8n/n8n-nodes-langchain.agent",
      "typeVersion": 1.7,
      "position": [
        1680,
        300
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
